## Worksheet

**F1 – Core loop**: `gameState` single object; `mulberry32(seed)` → `gameState.rng` used throughout; `endTurn()` resolves cooldowns→fatigue→needs→production→events→trade→storm→departures→win/lose in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 – Map**: 8x8 (`64` tiles) via `generateMap(seed)` using seeded rng; `checkBuildable` checks `building.terrain.includes(terrain)`; `getAdjacencyBonus` feeds `totalMult` in `calculateProduction`, changing `b.output`. Score 2.

**F3 – Economy**: `resolveBuildingProduction` computes produced/consumed but consumption failure never blocks that turn's production (no gating); caps/overflow handled via `resourceAccum`. Chain link broken. Score 1.

**F4 – Population**: colonists have id/name/job/skill/fatigue/morale/assignment; `c.skill` and `c.fatigue` read in `calculateProduction` (skillMult, fatigueDebuff). Score 2.

**F5 – Needs**: `resolvePopulationNeeds` consumes food/water, drops morale on shortfall; but `calculateProduction` never reads `c.morale` — morale never changes output. Score 1.

**F6 – Research**: 8 nodes in `RESEARCH_NODES`; prereqs enforced in `unlockResearch`/`getAvailableResearch`; costs deducted; but `synthesis` node's `metalToWater` effect is never read anywhere. Score 1.

**F7 – Events**: 10 entries in `EVENTS`; weighted pick in `fireEvent` (`totalWeight`, `rng()`); all have 2 differing choices; `eventState.cooldowns` decremented each turn, gates selection. Score 2.

**F8 – Trade**: `globalPrices` set once in `initTrade`, never updated by trades or stockpiles — only random noise `randInt(-1,1)` per caravan; `item.quantity` limited; `tradeCaravanBuy`/`Sell` both work. Score 1.

**F9 – Hazard**: `checkAndResolveStorm` fires periodically, `severity = turn/10+1` grows, research (`damageReduction`/`stormReduction`) reduces damage, `repairBuilding` costs parts — but `b.hp` is never read in `calculateProduction`, so damaged buildings don't produce less. Score 1.

**F10 – Save/load**: `serializeState()` full JSON, copied via textarea+`execCommand`; `deserializeState` parses in try/catch, `alert('Invalid save data...')` on bad input. Score 2.

**F11 – End conditions**: lose when `population===0`; win when `turn>=60 && population>=12`, both checked in `endTurn`; `showGameOver` computes `total_score` from population/research/resources/turn and renders summary. Score 2.

**F12 – UI**: tab click handlers switch `.active`; log entries carry `entry.turn` (`T{turn}:`); tooltips are shallow (no breakdown of research/fatigue multipliers); `keydown` handles Space and 1-5; no `@media` query, only CSS grid auto-fill reflow. Score 1.

**F13 – Dev panel**: `runTests()` has 15 real invariant assertions (caps, prereqs, terrain, save/load hash roundtrip); `runBenchmark()` runs 200 headless `endTurn()` calls and returns `hashState(gameState)`. Score 2.

**G1**: `unlockResearch` pushes to `research.completed`; `calculateProduction` reads `node.effects.buildingBonus[b.type]` every turn into `researchBonus`; `metalToWater` branch unused (minor gap). Score 3.

**G2**: `resolvePopulationNeeds` shortfall correctly drops `c.morale`, but morale is never read in `calculateProduction` — final link (morale→output) entirely absent. Score 1.

**G3**: `checkAndResolveStorm` reduces `b.hp`; `calculateProduction` never reads `b.hp` (no output loss); `repairBuilding` defined but has zero call sites anywhere in UI (dead code). Score 1.

**G4**: `generateCaravan` price = static `globalPrices[res] + randInt(-1,1)`; `globalPrices` never updated by stockpiles or over time. Link absent. Score 0.

**G5**: `applyEventChoice` writes distinct resource/morale/population deltas per choice for `dust_storm_minor`, `water_shortage`, `visitor`, etc., directly into `gameState.resources`/`colonists`. Score 4.

